 \cf2 Overview\cf4 \
\
 Create a systematic debugging playbook structure in cortex-gitops that captures source-grounded troubleshooting procedures, following the context-first\
 debugging model from GitHub Copilot Spaces article.\
\
 \cf2 Background Context\cf4 \
\
 \cf2 Current State\cf4 \
\
 - 19 existing markdown docs focused on status/architecture (no formal debugging playbooks)\
 - Excellent procedural documentation exists (\cf5 vulnerability-remediation-workflow.md\cf4 , \cf5 OPERATIONAL-PRINCIPLES.md\cf4 )\
 - Git history shows recurring issues: resource limits, image pulls, configuration errors, ArgoCD sync\
 - Documentation pattern established: tables, ASCII diagrams, step-by-step workflows\
\
 \cf2 Goal\cf4 \
\
 Create reusable debugging playbooks that:\
 1. Document source-grounded investigation steps (cite file paths, line numbers, kubectl commands)\
 2. Prevent re-discovering same patterns in future debugging sessions\
 3. Align with existing OPERATIONAL-PRINCIPLES.md ("STOP. ANALYZE. DESIGN.")\
 4. Follow existing documentation patterns\
\
